{#-
  all-builtins.jinja — Exhaustive showcase of every built-in filter and test.

  Every built-in in io.gravitee.jinja4j.filter.builtin and
  io.gravitee.jinja4j.test.builtin is invoked at least once here, producing
  one deterministic line per feature. The line format is:
      <section>: <name> -> <result>
-#}
